      "reason": "Audit WP18: adds the delivered-context systems (prompt_delivered, packet_delivered, hook_guard_accuracy), metric definitions and denominators, the holdout scope and the first task-level snapshot. The ranking diagnostics are unchanged.",
      "regressions": [],
      "removed": []
